WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.545
I... I'm the pilot of Evangelion Unit 01!

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.714
I'm Shinji Ikari!

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.677
Target has entered main shaft!

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.053
Now descending!

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.346
Where's it headed?!

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.598
It's heading straight for
the Central Dogma!

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.268
It's headed this way!
All personnel, evacuate! Hurry!

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.229
All personnel, evacuate!
I repeat, all personnel, evacuate!

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.577
Eva-01?!

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.287
Shinji?!

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.230
-Ms. Misato!
-Launch platform no. 5! Hurry!

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.718
I'm out of power!

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:37.097
Unit 01 has reached active time limit!
Backups are also down!

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.014
Shinji!

00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:47.982
Shinji!

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:49.150
Move!

00:01:50.735 --> 00:01:53.822
Come on, move! If you don't move,
this will all be for nothing!

00:02:06.918 --> 00:02:07.919
Is that the...

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:22.475
Move!

00:02:28.356 --> 00:02:29.774
Come on, move!

00:02:30.066 --> 00:02:33.403
If you don't move now... If I can't
do this now, everybody's gonna die!

00:02:33.778 --> 00:02:35.697
I don't want that, not anymore!

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:37.907
So I'm begging you! Move!

